  "content": "\n\n![Banner of the mod](https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol)\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/nFBAXfb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=5865f2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://github.com/iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=000000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=FF0000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/iglee42/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=f16436&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=1ace65&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></div>\n\n<br/>\n\n**Create Quality of Life — это аддон для [Create Mod](https://modrinth.com/mod/create)**\n\n**Этот аддон добавляет различные утилиты в Create Mod**\n\n**Текущая поддерживаемая версия Create: 6.0.8**\n\n![Separator](https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator)\n\n![Features Banner](https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol/features.png)\n\n![Chipped saw Banners](https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol/chipped_saw)\n\n![Inventory Linker Banner](https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol/linker.png)\n\n![Shadow Radiance Banner](https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol/shadow_radiance)\n\n![Schedule banner](https://api.iglee.fr/image/qol/schedule)\n\nВы можете использовать мод в своих модпаках, но запрещена его повторная публикация на других сайтах!\nCurseForge и Modrinth — единственные официальные площадки для распространения этого мода.\n\n<p><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/541199/description_4e1cb9c4-bc3f-41dd-8136-0e734888fb1f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"133\"></a></p>",
